---

This project orchestrates third-party Large Language Models (accessed through
a user-supplied, OpenAI-/Anthropic-/Gemini-compatible gateway) and uses the
following open-source tools at build/test time, each under its own license:

  - Apache Maven
  - JUnit 5
  - JaCoCo (line/branch coverage)
  - PIT / pitest (mutation testing)
  - Flask and Flask-CORS (Python backend)

No third-party source code is bundled in this repository; these tools are
resolved by the respective package managers at build time.
